 r←Test_TableEdit_012(stopFlag batchFlag);parms;n;⎕TRAP;table;rowTitles
⍝ Press <enter> in the last row. Adds a row with specific contents due to the setting of "rowPrototype" (vars).
⍝ See also Test_TableEdit_007 and Test_TableEdit_013.
 r←∆Inactive
 :Return

 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

⍝⍝⍝ Preconditions
 table←⍉⊃('Obama' 'Bush' 'Clinton' 'Reagan' 'Kennedy' 'Carter')(1 0 1 0 1 1)
 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Table.CreateParms
 parms.posn←35 25
 parms.size←400 600
 parms.colTitles←'Name' 'Democrat'
 parms.addToCaption←'Testing Table.Run'
 parms.confirmQuit←0
 parms.testMode←1
 parms.rowPrototype←'New' ¯2

 n←#._APLGUI.GUI.Table.Create table #._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults parms

 n.Grid.CurCell←⍴n.Grid.Values
 n.Grid ∆KeyPress⊂'ER'
 0.5 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →GoToTidyUp(⍴n.Grid.Values)≢1 0+⍴table
 →GoToTidyUp n.Grid.Values[¯1+↑⍴n.Grid.Values;]≢'New' ¯2

 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
